{"ts":"2026-08-25T05:11:42.545Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9b054e739855a3b67742faac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-a8zm","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## App portfolio\n\n- Context explorer showing why each item entered the token budget and what was omitted.\n- Relationship graph with typed paths, impact, critical path, communities, redundancy, provenance, and time travel.\n- Plan and milestone view with dependencies, decisions, discoveries, validation, and evidence.\n- Assurance dashboard with measurement provenance, gate verdicts, negative controls, and recurrence families.\n- Long-operation panel for task status, requested input, cancellation, and recovery.\n- Every mutation leaves the app through an explicit SDK-backed MCP tool with preview, consent, authority, and immutable receipt.\n- The app stores presentation state only and can be discarded without losing project state."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-pznhee"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"MCP Apps for pm: interactive graph, context, plan, assurance, and long-operation views with consent-safe action boundaries"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Expose optional interactive pm views as MCP Apps while keeping authoritative state and mutations in SDK-backed tools and resources."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:mcp","assurance","context","graph","interaction","long-term","mcp-apps","visualization"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:11:42.545Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:11:42.545Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2027-06-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":1200},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Each app reads authoritative SDK resources and never becomes a second tracker or mutable cache of record; All mutations use declared MCP tools with preview, consent, authority, idempotency, and immutable receipts; Graph and context explanations preserve typed edges, provenance, omissions, confidence, and token accounting; Accessibility, keyboard operation, reduced motion, large graphs, degraded connections, and stale data have explicit tests; Apps are optional extensions and absence never removes core CLI, SDK, or MCP functionality"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"Interactive context without creating a second project-management state"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Render graph exploration, context selection, plan progress, assurance verdicts, and task state through standard MCP App contracts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Humans and agents can inspect complex project relationships and evidence interactively while preserving one immutable source of truth"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"MCP Apps are a notable extension and pm already owns graph, context, plans, tasks, and assurance primitives that benefit from safe interactive presentation"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rs9vry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/ri